{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["先知指责百姓的罪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华的膀臂并非缩短，不能拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵并非发沉，不能听见，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们的罪孽使你们与 神隔绝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪恶使他掩面不听你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你们的手被血沾染，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的指头被罪孽沾污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的嘴唇说谎言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的舌头出恶语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无一人按公义告状，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无一人凭诚实辨白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都倚靠虚妄，说谎言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所怀的是毒害；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所生的是罪孽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们抱毒蛇蛋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"结蜘蛛网；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人吃这蛋必死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这蛋被踏，必出蝮蛇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所结的网不能成为衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所做的也不能遮盖自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的行为都是罪孽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手所做的都是强暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的脚奔跑行恶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们急速流无辜人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"意念都是罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所经过的路都荒凉毁灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安的路，他们不知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所行的事没有公平。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们为自己修弯曲的路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡行此路的都不知道平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["百姓悔罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"因此，公平离我们远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义追不上我们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们指望光亮，却是黑暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望光明，却行幽暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们摸索墙壁，好像瞎子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们摸索，如同无目之人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们晌午绊脚，如在黄昏一样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们在肥壮人中，像死人一般。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们咆哮如熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀鸣如鸽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望公平，却是没有；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望救恩，却远离我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的过犯在你面前增多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪恶作见证告我们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"过犯与我们同在。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于我们的罪孽，我们都知道：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是悖逆、不认识耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"转去不跟从我们的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说欺压和叛逆的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心怀谎言，随即说出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且公平转而退后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公义站在远处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诚实在街上仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正直也不得进入。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诚实少见；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离恶的人反成掠物。","poem":1},"耶和华准备拯救他的子民",{"text":"那时，耶和华看见没有公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚不喜悦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他见无人拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人代求，甚为诧异，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就用自己的膀臂施行拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公义扶持自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以公义为铠甲","poem":1},{"noteId":70},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以拯救为头盔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以报仇为衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以热心为外袍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必按人的行为施报，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恼怒他的敌人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报复他的仇敌","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向众海岛施行报应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["如此，人从日落之处必敬畏耶和华的名，",{"text":"从日出之地也必敬畏他的荣耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为仇敌好像急流的河水冲来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是耶和华之气所驱逐的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"必有一位救赎主来到锡安—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各族中转离过犯的人那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华说：「至于我与他们所立的约乃是这样：我加给你的灵，传给你的话，必不离你的口，也不离你后裔与你后裔之后裔的口，从今直到永远；这是耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":70,"caller":"-","text":"或译：护心镜","reference":{"chapter":59,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}